{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09540","headline":"早春陪崔中丞浣花溪宴得暄字 · 张谓","name":"早春陪崔中丞浣花溪宴得暄字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌节临溪口，寒郊斗觉暄。\n红亭移酒席，画鷁逗江村。\n云带歌声扬，风飘舞袖翻。\n花间催秉烛，川上欲黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}